  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is negative (sentiment < 0) or shows increasing negativity.",
    "Reduce forecast overshoot after sharp price spikes by applying a 1-2 day lag correction.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast is consistently above true outcome over 5+ days, reduce by 5-10% of the gap.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to recent true values when sentiment is positive (sentiment > 0) — especially in early window.",
    "Avoid overreacting to recent highs: if last 3 days show rising prices, cap forecast increase to 3% max.",
    "When sentiment is neutral (0.00), use 30-day moving average as baseline, then adjust ±2% based on volatility trend."
  ]
}
